sequenceDiagram
    participant HR as HackerRank Page
    participant Adapter as HackerRankAdapter
    participant Editor as Editor Capture
    participant Net as Network Intercept
    participant Result as Result Monitor
    participant Merger as Evidence Merger
    participant Life as Lifecycle Manager
    participant Dedup as Dedup Engine
    participant Queue as Persistent Queue
    participant API as Praxis API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    HR->>Adapter: Page detected
    Adapter->>Adapter: Problem URL = /challenges/arrays-ds/
    Adapter->>Editor: Start snapshot polling
    Adapter->>Net: Start network capture
    Adapter->>Result: Start result monitor

    HR->>HR: User clicks Submit
    Adapter->>Editor: Capture snapshot now
    Editor->>Merger: EditorEvidence (code)

    HR->>Net: POST /rest/contests/.../submit
    Net->>Merger: NetworkEvidence (submission request)

    HR->>Net: GET /rest/contests/.../submissions/483087426
    Net->>Merger: NetworkEvidence (submission response)

    HR->>Result: DOM shows Accepted
    Result->>Merger: ResultEvidence (ACCEPTED)

    Merger->>Merger: Merge all evidence
    Note over Merger: platformSubmissionId = 483087426

    Merger->>Life: CanonicalEvent
    Life->>Life: SUBMITTED → ACCEPTED (terminal)
    Life->>Dedup: Check dedup
    Dedup->>Queue: Enqueue event
    Queue->>API: POST /api/submissions
    API->>DB: Insert submission row
    DB-->>API: OK
    API-->>Queue: 200 Success
